---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'How to Set Up Alipay as a Foreigner (2026): Step-by-Step Guide';
const description = 'Step-by-step guide to setting up Alipay as a foreigner in China. Download, register with international number, verify identity, and link your foreign credit card.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/en/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Payment
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 Payment</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        How to Set Up Alipay as a Foreigner (2026)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">It takes about 15 minutes — here's exactly how.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 Last updated: June 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 5 min read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">🎯 Quick Answer</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Download Alipay, register with your international phone number, verify your identity with your passport, and link your foreign Visa/Mastercard.</strong> No Chinese bank account or phone number needed. Takes about 15 minutes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Let me walk you through this. I've done it myself and helped about a dozen friends do the same. <strong>It takes about 15 minutes</strong>, and you can do the whole thing before you even board your flight.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📱</span> Step 1: Download the App
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Go to your app store and search for <strong>"Alipay"</strong>. The developer is "Alipay (Hangzhou) Technology Co., Ltd." — that's the real one. There are some fakes out there so double-check.
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li><strong>iOS:</strong> App Store</li>
        <li><strong>Android:</strong> Google Play</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Your phone needs iOS 12+ or Android 8+. If your phone is more than 5–6 years old, you might run into issues.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📞</span> Step 2: Register with Your Phone Number
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Open the app and tap "Sign Up." You'll be asked for your phone number. The good news: <strong>you can use your own international phone number.</strong> Pick your country code from the dropdown (United States is +1, UK is +44, etc.), enter your number, and they'll send you a verification code via SMS.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛂</span> Step 3: Verify Your Identity
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>This is the most important step.</strong> Without ID verification, you can't use Alipay for payments.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        How it works:
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li>Go to <strong>Account → Identity Verification</strong></li>
        <li>Select <strong>"Foreign Passport"</strong> as your ID type</li>
        <li>Take a clear photo of your passport photo page</li>
        <li>Take a selfie (they'll compare it to your passport photo)</li>
        <li>Verification typically completes within a few minutes or up to 24 hours</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Make sure your passport photo page is well-lit and all text is readable. Blurry photos are the most common reason for verification failures.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💳</span> Step 4: Link Your Foreign Credit Card
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Go to <strong>Cards → Add Card</strong>. You can link any of the following:
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li><strong>Visa</strong> — Widely accepted</li>
        <li><strong>Mastercard</strong> — Widely accepted</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Enter your card number, expiry date, and CVV. Alipay typically does a small test charge (¥0.01–¥1.00) to verify the card. This charge is refunded automatically.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> You're All Set!
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        That's it. You can now use Alipay to pay at millions of merchants across China. When you're at a store, open the app, tap <strong>"Pay"</strong>, and scan the merchant's QR code.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        For metro and bus travel, you can also set up the <strong>transport QR code</strong> inside Alipay directly. Need help? Check the full payment overview for more details.
      </p>
    </div>

                <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 mt-8">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-50 to-blue-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-xl p-5 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">📚 Next Reads</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="/en/payment/payment-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              How to Pay in China
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/en/payment/setup-wechat/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              How to Set Up WeChat Pay as a Foreigner
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/en/payment/payment-fails/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              What to Do When Your Payment Fails
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="not-prose mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="text-lg">📚</span> Sources
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.alipayplus.com/consumer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 no-underline">
            <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400 group-hover:text-brand-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"></path></svg>
            <span class="border-b border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-700">Alipay - Consumers Center</span>
            <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-300 ml-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>